        "description": "The factory is the shared template for every victim account. Its runtime embeds the AccountProxy creation code whose constructor runs tstore(INIT_SLOT, 1), and its immutable ACCOUNT_IMPLEMENTATION pins StartaleSmartAccount 0x000000b8f5f723a680d3d7ee624fe0bc84a6e05a, whose initializeAccount checks only tload(INIT_SLOT). That implementation was deployed 1,212 s earlier (block 25079636) and is unchanged, so the factory deployment is the latest code change. The per-user proxies are created inside the exploit transactions and do not reset the template's age."
